From 128dc992e299881b1234f7a9c426a9ece07e4e91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jordan Bettcher <thebettcher@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:59:02 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 9/9] [flutter_tools] Fix icon tree shaking when building for
 desktop (backport)

Class: upstreamable fix, already upstream: cherry-pick of the
tool_backend.dart half of flutter #184249 (2f461fe90711, merged
2026-04-14, after 3.41 branched).

tool_backend.dart passed `-dTreeShakeIcons="true"` with the quotes as
part of the value (Process.start has no shell to strip them), so
IconTreeShaker saw `"true"` != `true` and never ran for Linux (or
Windows) desktop builds: a release bundle shipped the full 1.6 MB
MaterialIcons font, and const_finder and font-subset were never used.
The upstream change also routes macOS to its bundle target; kept as is.

Not taken: upstream's new permeable icon_tree_shaker_test.dart, which
needs a populated engine cache and hard-codes linux-x64/arm64 targets.
Verified instead with the managed ppc64 SDK (REPORT-M7): a release build
of the counter app now runs const_finder and font-subset from the
linux-ppc64 engine artifacts and bundles a subset MaterialIcons font.
---
 packages/flutter_tools/bin/tool_backend.dart | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/flutter_tools/bin/tool_backend.dart b/packages/flutter_tools/bin/tool_backend.dart
index 3d73b249..84536d00 100644
--- a/packages/flutter_tools/bin/tool_backend.dart
+++ b/packages/flutter_tools/bin/tool_backend.dart
@@ -76,8 +76,9 @@ or
     'bin',
     if (Platform.isWindows) 'flutter.bat' else 'flutter',
   ]);
-  final bundlePlatform = targetPlatform;
-  final target = '${buildMode}_bundle_${bundlePlatform}_assets';
+  final target = targetPlatform.startsWith('darwin')
+      ? '${buildMode}_macos_bundle_flutter_assets'
+      : '${buildMode}_bundle_${targetPlatform}_assets';
   final Process assembleProcess = await Process.start(flutterExecutable, <String>[
     if (verbose) '--verbose',
     if (prefixedErrors) '--prefixed-errors',
@@ -91,7 +92,7 @@ or
     '-dTrackWidgetCreation=$trackWidgetCreation',
     '-dBuildMode=$buildMode',
     '-dTargetFile=$flutterTarget',
-    '-dTreeShakeIcons="$treeShakeIcons"',
+    '-dTreeShakeIcons=$treeShakeIcons',
     '-dDartObfuscation=$dartObfuscation',
     if (codeSizeDirectory != null) '-dCodeSizeDirectory=$codeSizeDirectory',
     if (splitDebugInfo != null) '-dSplitDebugInfo=$splitDebugInfo',
